t;\">Question:</strong><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"> Has the Rajasthan <strong>RSMSSB Conductor Score Card 2026 been released?</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><strong style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: inherit;\">Answer: </strong>Yes, the <strong data-end=\"390\" data-start=\"346\" style=\"font-size: inherit; font-family: inherit;\">Rajasthan Staff Selection Board (RSMSSB)</strong><span style=\"font-size: inherit; font-family: inherit;\"> has released the </span><strong data-end=\"437\" data-start=\"408\" style=\"font-size: inherit; font-family: inherit;\">Conductor score card 2026</strong><span style=\"font-size: inherit; font-family: inherit;\"> on its official website for candidates who appeared in the examination.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the official website to download the <strong>RSMSSB Conductor Score Card 2026?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> Candidates can download the official score card from: https://rsmssb.rajasthan.gov.in</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<div class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"pt-0\">\n<div class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Question:</strong><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"> Can candidates raise objections to the <strong>RSMSSB Conductor Score Card 2026?</strong></span></span></li>\n<li class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, candidates can <strong data-end=\"1344\" data-start=\"1323\">submit objections</strong> if they find any discrepancies in the <strong data-end=\"1409\" data-start=\"1383\">provisional answer key</strong>. The objection link is available on the RSMSSB website for a limited period.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> Is there a fee for <strong>raising objections?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer: </strong>Yes, candidates need to pay a nominal fee per question while submitting objections to the provisional answer key. The fee amount and objection period are mentioned in the official notice.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the official website for <b>RSMSSB</b>?</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The official website for <strong>RSMSSB</strong> is <strong>https://rsmssb.rajasthan.gov.in/</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><img alt=\"RSSB Conductor Final Result 2026\" class=\"size-large wp-image-39328 aligncenter\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"576\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-2026-08-05T111430.392-1024x576.jpg\" srcset=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-2026-08-05T111430.392-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-2026-08-05T111430.392-300x169.jpg 300w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-2026-08-05T111430.392-768x432.jpg 768w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Off